  <name>WiiCompiled</name>
  <summary>Translate, compile, and play Mario Kart Wii natively on Linux</summary>
  <description>
    <p>
      WiiCompiled recompiles Mario Kart Wii into a native Linux binary.
      Point it at your own game dump and it translates the game code,
      compiles it with a bundled toolchain, and installs a playable build.
    </p>
    <p>
      The launcher shows whether the base game is installed, streams the
      compile log while it builds, and starts the game when it is ready.
    </p>
  </description>
  <launchable type="desktop-id">io.github.TeamWheelWizard.Wiicompiled.desktop</launchable>
  <provides>
    <binary>wiicompiled-gui</binary>
    <binary>wiicompiled-setup</binary>
  </provides>
